    tag: 'MPOS 2 inch',
    description: "Genesis Piggy is back with a fresh redesign, purpose-built for the Waveshare 2-inch touch LCD board. Same classic proportions, but with some key upgrades: a fully rotating head that can be positioned at any angle, a cleaner look with the cable routed behind the scenes, and easy button access from the piggy's rear.",
